th class="password-eye" d="M2.5 12s3.5-6 9.5-6 9.5 6 9.5 6-3.5 6-9.5 6-9.5-6-9.5-6Z"/><circle class="password-eye" cx="12" cy="12" r="2.8"/><path class="password-eye-slash" d="M4 4 20 20"/></svg></button></span></p><button class="membership-submit" type="submit"><?php esc_html_e( 'पासवर्ड बदलें', 'samanvay' ); ?> <span>→</span></button></form><?php endif; ?></div></div></section></main>
